  "ἄδην": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ἄδην, also written ἅδην (ᾱ̆) [cf. ἄω]. To the full, to\n   satiety Ε203.--So ἁ. ἐλόωσι πολέμοιο (will drive him\n   to satiety in the matter of war, give him his fill\n   of war) Ν315. Cf. Τ423: ε290.",
    "headword_normalized": "αδην"
