  "αἰπός": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "αἰπός, ή, όν [cf. next].\n1. Falling steeply down, flowing fast Θ369, Φ9.\n2. Of cities, set on a steep Ν625: γ130 = ν316, θ516,\n   λ533.",
