    "definition": "ἀκρά̄αντος [ἀ- + κραιαίνω].\n1. Not accomplished, not carried out: ἔργον Β138.\n2. Not to be fulfilled: ἔπεα τ565.--In neut. ἀκράαντον\n   as adv., without hope of fulfilment, to no purpose\n   β202.",
