    "definition": "ἀκρᾱής [ἄκρος + ἄημι]. (Cf. ὑπεραής.) Acc. sing.\n   ἀκρᾱῆ β421. Of wind, blowing at height; or perh.,\n   blowing with the right velocity or from the right\n   quarter β421, ξ253, 299.",
