  "ἀλαστέω": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ἀλαστέω [ἄλαστος]. (ἐπ-.) To find things intolerable:\n   ἠλάστεον θεοί (raged (impotently)) Ο21.--So in aor.\n   pple. ἀλαστήσας, giving way to such a feeling,\n   breaking out in protest Μ163.",
