    "definition": "ἀντίθεος, η [ἀντι- (4) + θεός]. Like the gods. A vague\n   general epithet of commendation Δ88, Ε663, Ι623,\n   Λ140, Ξ322, Ψ360, etc.: α21, δ571, ζ241, λ117, ξ18\n   (here merely conventional), ο90, etc.",
