  "ἀσπαίρω": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ἀσπαίρω.\n1. To gasp or pant in the death-struggle Γ293, Κ521,\n   Μ203, Ν571, 573: θ526, μ254, 255, τ229.\n2. Of convulsive movements of the limbs: πόδεσσιν τ231,\n   χ473.--Of the heart, to throb Ν443.",
