    "definition": "βουγά̄ϊος [app. a compound of βοῦς, perh. in intensive\n   sense. The second element perh. γαϜ-, γαίω]. Thus,\n   perh., braggart Ν824: σ79.",
    "headword_normalized": "βουγαιοσ"
