    ],
    "definition": "γλήνη, ης, ἡ [app. 'something bright.' Cf. next].\n1. The eye, the eyeball Ξ494: ι390.\n2. A plaything, a doll or puppet: ἔρρε, κακὴ γλήνη\n   Θ164.",
    "headword_normalized": "γληνη"
