  "δάπεδον": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "δάπεδον, ου, τό [δα- (app. referring to the work of\n   levelling, stamping, etc.) + πέδον, the ground].\n1. A levelled and prepared surface: ἐν τυκτῷ δαπέδῳ\n   δ627 = ρ169.\n2. A floor of a house Δ2: κ227, λ420, χ188, 309 = ω185,\n   χ455.--Of the under surface of the realm of Hades\n   λ577.",
    "headword_normalized": "δαπεδον"
  },
  "δάπτω": {
