  "διῑπετής": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "διῑπετής [app. fr. Διί, dat. of Ζεύς + πε-, πίπτω].\n   Thus, falling in the sky, i.e. rain-fed; or poss.,\n   falling by the power or ordinance of Zeus. Epithet\n   of rivers Π174, Ρ263, Φ268, 326: δ477, 581, η284.",
    "headword_normalized": "διιπετησ"
