    "definition": "διοϊστεύω [δι-, δια- (1) (2)].\n1. To shoot an arrow through. With genit.: πελέκεων\n   τ578 = φ76. Cf. τ587, φ97 = 127, φ114.\n2. To shoot an arrow over an indicated space μ102.",
