    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "δρυμά, τά [δρῦς].\n1. Thickets, coppices (prob. not nec. of oak) Λ118:\n   κ251.\n2. The pl. app. expressing vague mass or quantity\n   rather than plurality: ἐείσατο καπνὸς διὰ δ. κ150.\n   Cf. κ197.",
    "headword_normalized": "δρυμα"
