    "definition": "ἐσφέρω [ἐς-, εἰς- (2)].\n1. To carry into a specified place: ἐσθῆτα εἴσω η6.\n2. In mid., of a river, to draw into its current and\n   carry along with it: πολλὰς πεύκας Λ495.",
