    "definition": "†ἐσχέω [ἐς-, εἰς- (2)]. 3 pl. aor. pass. ἐσέχυντο. In\n   pass., of persons, to pour or stream into an\n   indicated or specified place: κατὰ πύλας Μ470, ἐς\n   πόλιν Φ610.",
    "headword_normalized": "εσχεω"
  },
