  "ἐΰς": {
    "inflected_forms": [
      "ἐΰν",
      "ἠΰν",
      "ἑῆος"
    ],
    "definition": "ἐΰς, ἐΰ. Acc. masc. ἐΰν Θ303: σ127. Also ἠΰς, ἠΰ. Acc.\n   masc. ἠΰν Ε628, Ζ8, 191, Υ457. From ἑεύς, genit.\n   masc. ἑῆος Α393, Ο138, Τ342, Ω422, 550: ξ505, ο450.\n1. Epithet of persons, good, goodly, serviceable or the\n   like Α393, Β653, Ζ191, Ν246, 691, Τ342, etc.: ι508,\n   ξ505, ο450, σ127.\n2. Such as may serve some end or confer benefit, good,\n   excellent: μένος ἠΰ Ρ456, Υ80, Ψ524, Ω6, 442: β271.",
    "headword_normalized": "ευσ"
  },
  "ἐΰσκαρθμος": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ἐΰσκαρθμος [ἐϋ- (1) + σκαίρω]. Bounding with nimble\n   feet, swift. Epithet of horses Ν31.",
