    "definition": "ἐΰσσελμος, ον [ἐϋ- (5) + σέλματα, rowing-benches].\n   Having goodly rowing-benches. Epithet of ships Β170,\n   Η84, Ι231, Λ193, Ξ97, etc.: β390, δ409, ι127, μ358,\n   ν101, etc.",
