    "definition": "ζέω. 3 sing. aor. ζέσσε Σ349: κ360. Of water, to boil\n   up, boil: ἐπεὶ ζέσσεν ὕδωρ (had come to the boil)\n   Σ349: = κ360.--Of the containing caldron: ὡς λέβης\n   ζεῖ ἔνδον Φ362.--Of the waters of a river exposed to\n   fire Φ365.",
