  "ζῶμα": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ζῶμα, τό [ζώννυμι. 'That which is girded about one'].\n1. A waist-cloth or apron, prob. of leather, worn in\n   warfare Δ187, 216: ξ482.\n2. Something of the same kind, but doubtless of lighter\n   material, worn in an athletic contest Ψ683.",
    "headword_normalized": "ζωμα"
