  "θρωσμός": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "θρωσμός [θρῴσκω]. Only in phrase ἐπὶ θρωσμῷ πεδίοιο, a\n   piece of ground rising from, and somewhat above the\n   general level of, the plain Κ160, Λ56 = Υ3.",
