    "definition": "ἰ̄ός, οῦ, ὁ. Acc. pl. ἰ̄ά Υ68. An arrow Α48, Γ80, Δ94,\n   Θ514, Π773, Τ59, Ψ862, etc.: α262, υ62, φ423, χ3,\n   15, 75, 82, 116, 119, 246. --In pl. ἰά denoting\n   rather vague quantity than plurality: ἔχων ἰά (a\n   quiverful) Υ68.",
