  "κρατερῶνυξ": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "κρατερῶνυξ, υχος [κρατερός + ὄνυξ]. With solid hooves,\n   strong-hoofed. Epithet of horses and mules Ε329,\n   Π724, 732, Ω277: ζ253, φ30. --Epithet of wolves,\n   with powerful claws, strong-clawed Κ218.",
    "headword_normalized": "κρατερωνυξ"
