    "definition": "κρυερός [κρύος, cold, chill]. Chilling, freezing,\n   numbing. Fig. as epithet of φόβος Ν48.--Of γόος\n   Ω524: δ103, λ212.",
    "headword_normalized": "κρυεροσ"
