    "definition": "κτυπέω [κτύπος]. 3 sing. aor. ἔκτυπε Θ75, Ο377, Ρ595:\n   φ413. κτύπε Θ170. To give forth a sound. Of crushed\n   or falling trees, to crash Ν140, Ψ119.--Of Zeus, to\n   thunder Η479, Θ75, 170, Ο377, Ρ595: φ413.",
