      "ἔβαλεν"
    ],
    "definition": "λέπαδνον, τό. The breast-strap against which a chariot-\n   horse pulled. Only in pl. (perh. so used to include\n   the girth): ἐν λέπαδνα κάλ’ ἔβαλεν Ε730. Cf. Τ393.",
