  "λιτή": {
    "inflected_forms": [
      "κοῦραι"
    ],
    "definition": "λιτή, ῆς, ἡ [λιτ-, λίσσομαι]. A prayer: εὐχω-λῇσι\n   λιτῇσί τε ἐλλισάμην (the two words hardly to be\n   distinguished) λ34.--Personified: Λιταί εἰσι (there\n   are such beings as ...) Διὸς κοῦραι Ι502 (i.e.\n   prayers of repentance, for forgiveness, addressed by\n   an offender to the person injured).",
