  "μάργος": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "μάργος, η. Out of one's wits, beside oneself ψ11.--\n   Absol. in voc., 'madman !' π421.--Applied to the\n   belly, raging, unappeasable σ2.",
    "headword_normalized": "μαργοσ"
