    ],
    "definition": "μετατρέπομαι [μετα- (1). 'To turn oneself so as to\n   follow with one's view']. To have regard for, care\n   for, trouble oneself about. With genit.: τῶν οὔ τι\n   μετατρέπῃ Α160. Cf. Ι630, Μ238.",
    "headword_normalized": "μετατρεπομαι"
