  "νῆις": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "νῆις, ιδος [νη- + (Ϝ)ιδ-, εἴδῳ]. Lacking knowledge,\n   unskilled Η198.--Lacking knowledge of, unskilled in.\n   With genit.: ἀέθλων θ179.",
