    ],
    "definition": "νῶροψ, οπος. App., gleaming, glancing, or the like.\n   Epithet of χαλκός Β578, Η206, Λ16, Ν406, Π130, Ξ383:\n   = ω467 = 500.",
    "headword_normalized": "νωροψ"
