  "ξένιος": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ξένιος, η, -ον [= ξείνιος].\n1. That serves as a symbol of the obligations of a\n   guest in reference to his host or of the claims of a\n   stranger to protection: ἴστω ξενίη τράπεζα ξ158 = ρ\n   = 155 = υ230.\n2. = ξείνιος (1) ξ389.\n3. Absol. in neut. pl. = ξείνιος (3) ο514, 546.",
    "headword_normalized": "ξενιοσ"
  },
  "ξερός": {
