    ],
    "definition": "ὀϊζύς, ύος, ἡ.\n1. Sorrow, grief, woe, distress, hardship: πόνον τ’\n   ἐχέμεν καὶ ὀϊζύν Ν2. Cf. Ζ285, Ξ480: γ103, δ35,\n   ε289, η211, 270, etc.\n2. The result of pains or painful toil Ο365.",
    "headword_normalized": "οιζυσ"
  },
  "ὀϊζύω": {
    "inflected_forms": [
