    "definition": "ὀλολύζω. 3 sing. aor. ὀλόλυξε δ767. 3 pl. ὀλόλυξαν\n   γ450. Infin. ὀλολύξαι χ408. To shout in exultation\n   or triumph (always of women) χ408, 411.--Sim. of an\n   ecstatic shout of women at a religious ceremony\n   γ450, δ767.",
