    "definition": "ὅρμος, ου, ὁ. An anchorage, moorings, a landing-place\n   Α435: = ο497, ν101.",
    "headword_normalized": "ορμοσ"
  },
  "ὄρνεον": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "ὄρνεον, τό [cf. next]. A bird Ν64.",
