  },
  "παρήορος": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "παρήορος [παρ-, παρα- (2) + ἠορ-, ἀείρω. 'Hung on at\n   the side,' 'dangling loosely.' Cf. συνήορος,\n   τετράοροι].\n1. Sprawling Η156.--Loose or uncontrolled in mind,\n   flighty Ψ603.\n2. As sb., an extra trace-horse attached to a chariot\n   Π471, 474.",
    "headword_normalized": "παρηοροσ"
  },
