    "definition": "πάσσω. (ἐμ-.)\n1. To let fall in shreds or small particles, sprinkle:\n   φάρμακα Δ219, Ε401,  900, Λ515, 830, Ο394, ἁλός\n   (partitive genit.) Ι214.\n2. In weaving, to insert in a web Χ441.",
    "headword_normalized": "πασσω"
