  "πειράζω": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "πειράζω [cf. πειράω]. To make proof or trial of (a\n   person). With genit.: ἀνδρῶν π319, ἐμέθεν ψ114.--To\n   make trial of a person's sagacity, try to elicit\n   information from him, pump him: ὣς φάτο πειράζων\n   ι281.",
    "headword_normalized": "πειραζω"
