    "definition": "πόρις, ἡ = πόρτις κ410.",
    "headword_normalized": "πορισ"
  },
  "πόρκης": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "πόρκης, ὁ. In a spear, a metal ferrule, or perh. a\n   lashing of wire, securing the tongue of the head\n   (see καυλός (1) (a)) in the shaft Ζ320 = Θ495.",
    "headword_normalized": "πορκησ"
