    "definition": "πρέπω. (ἐπι-, μετα-.) To be pre-eminent, conspicuous,\n   distinguished, noted: ἔπρεπε καὶ διὰ πάντων Μ104.\n   Cf. θ172, σ2 (was noted for his ...).",
    "headword_normalized": "πρεπω"
