    "definition": "πρόχοος, ου, ἡ [προχέω].\n1. A vessel for holding water to be poured on the hands\n   Ω304: α136 = δ52 = η172 = κ368 = ο135 = ρ91.\n2. A vessel from which to pour wine into the cups σ397.",
    "headword_normalized": "προχοοσ"
