    "definition": "σέβομαι. To be moved by respect for the opinion of\n   others, fear what others may think or say, think\n   shame (cf. αἰδέομαι (4)): οὔ νυ σέβεσθε; Δ242.",
    "headword_normalized": "σεβομαι"
