    "definition": "σχεδίη, ης, ἡ. A raft. Of the raft which Odysseus\n   constructed on Calypso's island and on which he\n   passed to Phaeacia ε33, 163, 174, 177, 251, 314,\n   315, 324, 338, 343, 357, 363, η264, 274.",
