  "τάφρος": {
    "inflected_forms": [],
    "definition": "τάφρος, ου, ἡ.\n1. A narrow excavation in the ground, a trench:\n   πελέκεας στῆσε, διὰ τάφρον ὀρύξας φ120.\n2. A ditch or fosse protecting a fortified place. Of\n   the ditch dug about the Greek camp Η341, Θ179, Ι67,\n   Λ48, Μ4, etc.",
    "headword_normalized": "ταφροσ"
  },
  "ταφών": {
