    "definition": "τέλσον, τό. In ploughing, the headland (of a field),\n   the strip at each end of the furrows at the edge of\n   which the plough is turned: τ. ἀρούρης Ν707, Σ544.\n   Cf. Σ547.",
    "headword_normalized": "τελσον"
