  "τέμενος": {
    "inflected_forms": [
      "τάμον",
      "βασιλήϊον"
    ],
    "definition": "τέμενος, τό [τέμνω].\n1. A piece of land marked off from common land and held\n   in severalty, i.e. as private enclosed property: τ.\n   τάμον Ζ194, Υ184, τ. βασιλήϊον Σ550. Cf. Ι578, Μ313,\n   Υ391: ζ293, λ185, ρ299.\n2. A piece of land similarly marked off and dedicated\n   to the service of a god or goddess: Πύρασον,\n   Δήμητρος τ. (i.e. Pyrasus with its ...) Β696. Cf.\n   Θ48, Ψ148: θ363.",
    "headword_normalized": "τεμενοσ"
  },
  "τέμνω": {
