  "φθονέω": {
    "inflected_forms": [
      "φθονέουσα"
    ],
    "definition": "φθονέω (ἐπι-).\n1. To dislike the idea of something, be dissatisfied at\n   the prospect of it, be reluctant to allow or do it,\n   begrudge the doing of it: εἴ περ φθονέω ... οὐκ ἀνύω\n   φθονέουσα Δ55: οὔ τοι φθονέω (I make no objection)\n   ρ400. --With complementary infin.: δόμεναί τινα σ16.\n   Cf. α346, λ381, τ348.\n2. To be reluctant to give or grant or to see given or\n   granted, begrudge, be grudging of. With genit.:\n   ἡμιόνων ζ68, ἀλλοτρίων σ18.",
    "headword_normalized": "φθονεω"
  },
  "φιάλη": {
    "inflected_forms": [
