    ],
    "definition": "φοξός. Explained as 'warped in burning' (of pottery);\n   hence, distorted, deformed: φοξὸς ἔην κεφαλήν Β219.",
    "headword_normalized": "φοξοσ"
  },
  "φορβή": {
